problems.problemStatement:
Parse a simplified Compute Engine instance resource name of the exact form:

projects/{projectId}/zones/{zone}/instances/{instanceName}

All literal markers must match exactly and each variable segment must be nonempty. Reject leading slashes, trailing slashes, or additional segments. Print the project ID, zone and instance name on separate lines for valid input, otherwise print INVALID.

